            "taskDemandEn": "Fresh main-group case: Mg12 protons,2|8|2; O8 protons,2|6. Only simple atomic ions in the school noble-gas model are considered. Write electron loss/gain and explain why Mg2+ and O2− each have10 electrons despite different charges.",
